sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant O as Operator (Priya)
    participant A as Agent
    participant B as Background model
    participant E as Entity memory
    O->>A: plan_memory_consolidation(threads)
    A->>E: read the entities and the named conversations
    A->>B: which records are one thing? what did the user state that isn't stored? what did they say again?
    B-->>A: suggestions, each with the user's words
    A->>A: code checks — the quote is in a user message · it is newer than the stored value · merges need evidence · the source rule
    A-->>O: a plan (nothing has changed)
    O->>A: apply_memory_consolidation(plan, approved_by="priya.shah")
    A->>E: merge + alias · add facts · count confirmations · retire replaced values
    A->>E: flag skills and notes that still state a replaced value
    Note over E: nothing deleted — every change is tagged with the plan id
    O->>A: restore_memory_consolidation(plan_id) — if it was wrong
    A->>E: walk the tags backwards
